    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18e263747f4c4e225084cd63",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花千代王，\n这位赛马娘从崇拜的前辈・丸善斯基身上\n继承了梦想，下定决心挑战“日本德比”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f17ae7bb4e54611cfc1dcc54f19203e7bec1357d0c7daa03d4ec727e104b7f5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca16a6815d74d0e0caaaa329",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee8b9d4875a001d7fd51fcaf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "尽管同期中不乏像是目白阿尔丹、八重无敌等\n众所瞩目的选手，她仍脚踏实地地贯彻努力，\n只为实现目标称霸德比。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b99dce158378adeec4c1784709e13e66763414a41bd6c5e76dcddfd06da6a9a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
