    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7af77d623e58927faec17a58",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c0f916bdbb2b61742a37d27",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "丸善斯基则在一旁远远地守候。\n不过她最近似乎正逐渐淡出闪耀系列赛……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3604d2e77453495147655a299de1cb0d457f5a369e2909eecc5653b4fcb1b4d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f71c5026c999804761d916bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0404d6601fa4616e387e1170",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但樱花千代王仍想变得能与她匹敌，\n并且将胜过她视为目标之一。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93c874ca89df41b296d752be2b9196dab9606ea3bf90ea48d5e50ed001007a3d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
