    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93c4967461c46460f9ccc210",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "皋月赏即将到来的某天，\n目白阿尔丹与八重无敌两人同时告知\n樱花千代王“想尽量避免一起并跑练习”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "baea50ac86ff525d9ae6c89aab4ec83ee5dcd5e998f134fbda73c8b549ddb10c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86b7e11bba3aea62055a7292",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7f41fce183cb4d4f6943a84",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白阿尔丹已经下了决心。\n即使双脚粉碎，也要创造只属于自己\n且不输给伟姐姐的瞬间光辉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26434a29fe936567983c9c5aed19739e7ac5b5e147f8a2fed11902ed71561468",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2de1cfd0e03a7e222961fc1b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3287ca2e8d6ec4012df288c8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "八重无敌则是回忆起这一路走来，\n祖父带给自己数不尽的支持。\n她想要报恩而亟欲证明自己有所成长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02862f802bdf71effe154f8980100fc75c01d80f6c263af502bb52166dd1bfa4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:170ff54a22deb911147cd7a1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea5b512955c928fc3edb9e4e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但樱花千代王同样抱着强烈的意念。\n明明丸善斯基拥有压倒性的实力，\n当时的她却没能参赛德比。既然如此──",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff2981c3ec19364cd2b7d661c78633be12acf71639f72c5051f66334a3fbb261",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cb04cdf706affe648e969e5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a510a53247c99034889ca733",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就由崇拜丸善斯基并继承梦想的自己\n赢得胜利，来证明丸善斯基的实力。\n……她也有绝不能输的理由。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab3e136075e21d87dd9997f98981465c7ed7372274af76af1925dd1812115964",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069401.json",
