    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edfbe5bdf78abc7825b285b5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白阿尔丹与八重无敌都抱着坚强信念。\n而樱花千代王也再度体认到，\n自己肩负着丸善斯基托付的梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9fbeabfc919a4eaaa5a0bce50014f4e6cc65e5f230f89c2ec3777773c2ab10e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
