    {
      "uid": "zhcn:825d102be9dfcfd90563fd91",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能够理解她不想输给劲敌的心情，\n但无论如何都不能放着她继续逞强，\n导致她的赛跑生涯缩短。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62d57afc50b9c80255545844db4f936ef136088e604beb478e5f6d112f8f807b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069402.json",
      "json_path": [
