    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea756334be4f69a5d3540243",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她为了不输给崇拜的对象开始收集\n比赛资料。但跟千明代表聊过后，\n在她心中产生了某种怀疑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "744695cd459a33abe74fb3c042db609567127c3f8606fd27c22dab306fb7cfb5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
