    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e3fea2eadc88fd07f9815aa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后她在比赛的过程中变得肯定。\n──这个人至今从未使出全力比赛过，\n从未感受过“绝不想输”的心情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce2000d1f240267c61ccceea762fb047ce662f5e64a219ef7bf502188ee5a1ca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
