    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d8501bbc0b48f8559e6b916",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这同时也证明了\n自己还尚未被她认可为劲敌，\n樱花千代王不愿如此而再度振奋起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad28f4bce9255707ae78402f7c91f5c83d687f4d865ca28f3ae9f86099ad1926",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069403.json",
