    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a58cbd97a7cb8e7b386a92d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她对犹豫不前的丸善斯基说“我一定会\n点燃你的心”，并决定主动挑战古马级选手\n也会参赛的“天皇赏（秋）”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd5cb947174adb9d81a44ef20f6dfdbe219009aba9ca64c5c641a558703da448",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069403.json",
      "json_path": [
