    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bb68269abef6624310b94d4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "丸善斯基持续调整状态。她还没找回\n巅峰时期时的感觉。但为了约定之战日本杯，\n她仍稳健扎实地持续累积实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f6046670c84fc3ec3ab8c6f9ad3a71dde40573c4c59cff69cd9410aaf4e2b3e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
