    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2fb708d22f62b18ad4f030b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，不安一旦萌生就再也难以挥去。\n她仿佛祈求似地问着训练员……\n“我还有机会成为那个人的劲敌吧？”",
      "source_fingerprint": "dceb05e77f6624b6e740f321416cae228389c558eb780ae149e535f166be6de6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
