      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此时，八重无敌邀请她一同观摩比赛，\n亲眼看到目白阿尔丹彻底复活，\n并且展现出更胜以往的实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3aad37f30e0bba230484660cb63a50107a60f9f4d6fb547309b002e96c3dfe1c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
